---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout pageTitle="Consulting">
    <div class="page-container">
        <h1>Consulting</h1>

        <p class="intro-text">
            I take on project-based work for Microsoft 365 and Windows Server infrastructure.
        </p>
        
        <section>
            <h2>Areas of expertise</h2>
            
            <ul class="custom-list">
                <li>
                    <span class="list-item-title">Microsoft 365 Migrations</span>
                    <span class="list-item-description">I have worked on a variety of tenant-to-tenant migrations and on-premises to cloud transitions. In these projects, I am typically responsible for managing identity migration and email migration. Projects range from only a few dozen users up to over 100,000 mailboxes.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="list-item-title">Active Directory and Domain Controllers</span>
                    <span class="list-item-description">For identity management, Active Directory is still the core service in many organizations. I work with organizations to troubleshoot Active Directory configuration issues and implement new Domain Controllers. I am experienced working with complex environments with hundreds of  locations, high user volumes, and multiple domains.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="list-item-title">Hybrid Environments</span>
                    <span class="list-item-description">Larger organizations typically synchronize identities between Active Directory and Entra ID. I implement Entra ID Connect and Entra Cloud sync for synchronization. I also support Exchange hybrid environments.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="list-item-title">Public Key Infrastructure (PKI) and Certificates</span>
                    <span class="list-item-description">If you have deployed Active Directory Certificate Services (AD CS) to support deploying internal certificates for applications and domain controllers, I can assist with migrating to a new supported operating system. I can also help you design new PKI infrastructure using public certificate authorities and automation.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>
                Inquire about consulting services by sending an email to <a href="mailto:info@btwsolutions.ca">info@btwsolutions.ca</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>
